---
layout: shell.njk
title: 归档
permalink: /archive/
navKey: archive
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">// WRITING</p>
    <h1>文章归档 <span lang="en">All writing</span></h1>
    <p>按时间浏览所有公开笔记、技术拆解与源码文章。</p>
  </header>

  {% if blog.years.length %}
    {% for group in blog.years %}
      <div class="section-label">{{ group.year }}</div>
      {% set items = group.posts %}
      {% set featuredList = false %}
      {% include "post-list.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty">还没有文章。</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
